/T (Futura PT is a well-balanced, sans serif typeface. It can be accessed using Adobe Fonts. In cases where Futura PT  is either unavailable or  unsuitable, appropriate  substitutes are Work Sans and Jost available via  fonts.google.com.  When writing documents that will be shared with the public, Jost should be used for Titles and headings, and Work Sans for the body of the text)
